            "source": [
                "# **Atp Sql de la base de datos**\n",
                "\n",
                "## **Script Base:**\n",
                "\n",
                "A continuación se muestra una base **SIN REGISTROS** de la base de datos. Se incluyen las tablas \n"
            ]
        },
        {
            "cell_type": "markdown",
            "metadata": {},
            "source": [
                "### <span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; color: var(--vscode-foreground);\"><b>Tabla Usuarios</b></span>"
            ]
        },
        {
            "cell_type": "code",
            "execution_count": null,
            "metadata": {
                "azdata_cell_guid": "710c11ad-40f1-4611-962e-f5962f02a2fa",
                "language": "sql",
                "tags": [
                    "hide_input"
                ]
            },
            "outputs": [],
            "source": [
                "-- Crear la tabla Usuarios\n",
                "CREATE TABLE Usuarios (\n",
                "    idUsuario NUMBER PRIMARY KEY,\n",
                "    Nombre VARCHAR2(100) NOT NULL,\n",
                "    Correo VARCHAR2(100) NOT NULL,\n",
                "    TokenChannel VARCHAR2(100) NULL,\n",
                "    Telefono VARCHAR2(100) NOT NULL,\n",
                "    UsuarioT VARCHAR2(100) NULL,\n",
                "    Activo NUMBER(1) DEFAULT 1 CHECK (Activo IN (0,1))\n",
                ");\n",
                "\n",
                "-- Secuencia de Auto Incremento \n",
                "CREATE SEQUENCE Usuarios_seq START WITH 1 INCREMENT BY 1;\n",
                "CREATE OR REPLACE TRIGGER Usuarios2_trg\n",
                "BEFORE INSERT ON Usuarios\n",
                "FOR EACH ROW\n",
                "BEGIN\n",
                "    IF :NEW.idUsuario IS NULL THEN\n",
                "        SELECT Usuarios_seq.NEXTVAL INTO :NEW.idUsuario FROM DUAL;\n",
                "    END IF;\n",
                "END;\n",
                "/"
            ]
        },
        {
            "attachments": {},
            "cell_type": "markdown",
            "metadata": {
                "azdata_cell_guid": "a93d5dde-dab5-4588-9fc8-b380a2b1be8c"
            },
            "source": [
                "### **Tabla Manager**"
            ]
        },
        {
            "cell_type": "code",
            "execution_count": null,
            "metadata": {
                "azdata_cell_guid": "79532972-94a4-4f3c-87e5-722cba5c665e",
                "language": "sql",
                "tags": [
                    "hide_input"
                ]
            },
            "outputs": [],
            "source": [
                "CREATE TABLE TODOUSER.Manager (\n",
                "    idManage NUMBER PRIMARY KEY,\n",
                "    idUsuario NUMBER NULL,\n",
                "    Activo NUMBER(1) DEFAULT 1 CHECK (Activo IN (0,1)),\n",
                "    CONSTRAINT fk_Manager_Usuario FOREIGN KEY (idUsuario) REFERENCES TODOUSER.Usuarios(idUsuario)\n",
                ");\n",
                "\n",
                "-- Secuencia de Auto Incremento \n",
                "CREATE SEQUENCE TODOUSER.Manager_seq START WITH 1 INCREMENT BY 1;\n",
                "\n",
                "-- Trigger para auto incremento de idManage\n",
                "CREATE OR REPLACE TRIGGER TODOUSER.Manager_trg\n",
                "BEFORE INSERT ON TODOUSER.Manager\n",
                "FOR EACH ROW\n",
                "BEGIN\n",
                "    IF :NEW.idManage IS NULL THEN\n",
                "        SELECT Manager_seq.NEXTVAL INTO :NEW.idManage FROM DUAL;\n",
                "    END IF;\n",
                "END;\n",
                "/"
            ]
        },
        {
            "attachments": {},
            "cell_type": "markdown",
            "metadata": {
                "azdata_cell_guid": "92bc8461-9ee4-4633-987f-b67d4f54698c",
                "language": "sql"
            },
            "source": [
                "### **Tabla Equipo**"
            ]
        },
        {
            "cell_type": "code",
            "execution_count": null,
            "metadata": {
                "azdata_cell_guid": "1488a742-309b-4880-90f7-1b7c97732e7b",
                "language": "sql",
                "tags": [
                    "hide_input"
                ]
            },
            "outputs": [],
            "source": [
                "-- Crear la tabla Equipo\n",
                "CREATE TABLE TODOUSER.Equipo (\n",
                "    idEquipo NUMBER PRIMARY KEY,\n",
                "    Nombre VARCHAR2(100) NOT NULL,\n",
                "    Notificacion TIMESTAMP NULL,\n",
                "    Activo NUMBER(1) DEFAULT 1 CHECK (Activo IN (0,1))\n",
                ");\n",
                "\n",
                "-- Secuencia de Auto Incremento\n",
                "CREATE SEQUENCE TODOUSER.Equipo_seq START WITH 1 INCREMENT BY 1;\n",
                "CREATE OR REPLACE TRIGGER TODOUSER.Equipo_trg\n",
                "BEFORE INSERT ON TODOUSER.Equipo\n",
                "FOR EACH ROW\n",
                "BEGIN\n",
                "    IF :NEW.idEquipo IS NULL THEN\n",
                "        SELECT TODOUSER.Equipo_seq.NEXTVAL INTO :NEW.idEquipo FROM DUAL;\n",
                "    END IF;\n",
                "END;\n",
                "/"
            ]
        },
        {
            "attachments": {},
            "cell_type": "markdown",
